    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32512" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">ŏlor</span></b> , ōris,
			m., <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>a swan</i> (<b>poet.</b> and in  post-Aug. prose for cygnus): 
